namespace UObjectToolTips

DreamParkedWidgetEntry {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamUIManager.h#DreamParkedWidgetEntry
    src   "A widget that has been created but not yet added to anything -- the state a UMG-style\nCreateWidget hands back. The manager holds it for two reasons: it is the GC anchor (nothing\nelse references a parentless widget), and holding it in a named, countable place is what makes\n\"created and then forgotten\" a visible leak rather than a silent one."
    text  "已创建但尚未添加到任何东西上的控件——即 UMG 风格的\nCreateWidget 返回的状态。管理器持有它有两个原因：它是 GC 锚点（没有\n其他对象引用无父级的控件），而把它放在一个有名称、可计数的位置，正是让\n“创建后即被遗忘”成为可见泄漏而非无声泄漏的原因。"
    state machine
}

DreamParkedWidgetEntry:ParkedAtSeconds {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamUIManager.h#DreamParkedWidgetEntry:ParkedAtSeconds
    src   "Seconds on the world clock, for the optional never-attached diagnostic."
    text  "世界时钟上的秒数，用于可选的“从未附加”诊断。"
    state machine
}

DreamUIManagerWorldSubsystem:AllSelectableArray {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamUIManager.h#DreamUIManagerWorldSubsystem:AllSelectableArray
    src   "Every registered selectable, as the behaviour it is. The navigation scan and the input system walk\nit; neither needs the core to know the selectable class, which belongs to the input system."
    text  "每个已注册的可选择对象，以其行为本身的形式存在。导航扫描和输入系统都会遍历\n它；两者都不需要核心知道可选择类，那属于输入系统。"
    state machine
}

DreamUIManagerWorldSubsystem:FreeRoots {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamUIManager.h#DreamUIManagerWorldSubsystem:FreeRoots
    src   "The roots of registered trees nothing but this manager holds: made with no host (CreateDreamWidget\nwith no parent, a Blueprint's ConstructWidget, a test's widget made straight in the world), or taken\noff their parent while registered. The pool is the manager's to empty -- on attach, on destroy, and\nat the world's teardown -- and nothing in it is reported as a leak."
    text  "仅由本管理器持有的已注册树的根：没有宿主的（CreateDreamWidget\n无父级、蓝图的 ConstructWidget、测试直接在世界中创建的控件），或在注册期间\n从其父级移除的。该池由管理器负责清空——附加时、销毁时以及\n世界清理时——池中任何内容都不会被报告为泄漏。"
    state machine
}

DreamUIManagerWorldSubsystem:PaintRows {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamUIManager.h#DreamUIManagerWorldSubsystem:PaintRows
    src   "See CreatePaintRows: the rows, the manager's, and never saved, duplicated or copied, as the rect block rows."
    text  "See CreatePaintRows: the rows, the manager's, and never saved, duplicated or copied, as the rect block rows."
    state machine
}

