DreamUIManagerWorldSubsystem:RegisteredWidgets {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamUIManager.h#DreamUIManagerWorldSubsystem:RegisteredWidgets
    src   "Every registered widget, weakly: registering is not owning. A tree is kept alive by its host --\nthe component, subsystem or preview that made it -- and the host lets it go; see FreeRoots for the\ntrees no host holds."
    text  "所有已注册控件均为弱引用：注册并不代表拥有。树由其宿主保持存活——\n即创建它的组件、子系统或预览——并由宿主释放；没有宿主的树\n参见 FreeRoots。"
    state machine
}

